<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia soymeal imports July 1-31.</title>
<headline>Indonesia soymeal imports July 1-31.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imports of soymeal through Belawan port  in North Sumatra, and Tanjung Priok Port, Jakarta in July, 1997, based  on data made available to Reuters by the port authorities.</p>
<p>BELAWAN</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHIP		   DATE/ARRIVAL	 CARGO/TONNES    FROM</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Kun Gang	  05-07-97	     soymeal	   India</p>
<p>						  9,200 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Evmar	     18-07-97	     soymeal	   Surabaya</p>
<p>						  8,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>TANJUNG PRIOK</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>N I L</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Jakarta Newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
